; Module-definition file for the guest Vulkan shim (vulkan-1.dll replacement).
;
; Exports the Vulkan entry points under their PLAIN, undecorated names. This matters on 32-bit
; (WOW64) guests: VKAPI_CALL is __stdcall, which name-decorates exports on x86 (e.g.
;   _vkGetInstanceProcAddr@8), so a guest GetProcAddress("vkGetInstanceProcAddr") would miss them.
; A .def exports undecorated names on both x86 and x64, exactly as the real vulkan-1.dll does.
; Keep this list in sync with the exported functions in vulkan_shim.cpp.
EXPORTS
    vkAcquireNextImageKHR
    vkAllocateCommandBuffers
    vkAllocateDescriptorSets
    vkAllocateMemory
    vkSetDeviceMemoryPriorityEXT
    vkBeginCommandBuffer
    vkBindBufferMemory
    vkBindImageMemory
